  "plain": "In 1996 in Varginha, Brazil, where a strange creature is said to have been captured and treated, a doctor named Jannini reportedly wrote a laboratory report saying the creature died of a lung infection that led to septicemia, an infection spreading through the whole body. A surgeon named Ahmed Foratu, who says his hospital operated on the being, describes the report to Michels. If true, it would be a medical record of an alien's death."
